    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d237">

                <pb facs="0669" n="547" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg547"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Mutsu.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-03-12"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 12,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to our conversation of this
                    afternoon, I take pleasure in now informing you that provision has been made for
                    paying $15,000 to your Government, as indemnity for injuries caused to Japanese
                    subjects by explosion of shells from the United States steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Omaha.</hi></p>
                <p>Measures will at once be taken to effect this payment at an early day.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
